sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer as Customer
    participant Frontend as React 19 Frontend
    participant Gateway as Express API / Middleware
    participant Database as MongoDB Atlas
    participant Payment as Razorpay Gateway
    participant Realtime as Socket.IO Hub

    Note over Customer, Realtime: 1. Registration & Authentication
    Customer->>Frontend: Register / Login with Email & Password
    Frontend->>Gateway: POST /api/auth/login
    Gateway->>Database: Verify Bcrypt Hash
    Database-->>Gateway: User Verified
    Gateway-->>Frontend: 200 OK + Set HttpOnly Cookies (vp_access, vp_refresh, vp_csrf)
    Frontend-->>Customer: Authenticated Session Active

    Note over Customer, Realtime: 2. Catalog Search & Cart Management
    Customer->>Frontend: Search Products / Filter by Category
    Frontend->>Gateway: GET /api/catalog/search?q=...&category=...
    Gateway->>Database: Query Listings & Inventory
    Database-->>Gateway: Matched Active Products
    Gateway-->>Frontend: Product Catalog Data
    Frontend-->>Customer: Display Products with Live Pricing
    Customer->>Frontend: Click "Add to Cart"
    Frontend->>Gateway: POST /api/cart/items (listingId, quantity)
    Gateway->>Database: Validate Stock & Upsert Cart
    Database-->>Gateway: Cart Updated
    Gateway-->>Frontend: 200 OK with Subtotal in Paise

    Note over Customer, Realtime: 3. Checkout, Payment & Order Confirmation
    Customer->>Frontend: Proceed to Checkout & Select Address
    Frontend->>Gateway: POST /api/orders/checkout (addressId, method: "razorpay")
    Gateway->>Database: Start Transaction & Reserve Stock
    alt Stock Available
        Gateway->>Payment: Create Razorpay Order
        Payment-->>Gateway: rzp_order_id
        Gateway-->>Frontend: Order Pending + Payment Details
        Frontend->>Customer: Open Razorpay Payment Modal
        Customer->>Payment: Authorize UPI / Card / NetBanking
        Payment-->>Frontend: Payment Success Response (Signature)
        Frontend->>Gateway: POST /api/payments/verify (Signature Verification)
        Gateway->>Database: Confirm Order & Commit Stock Decrement
        Gateway->>Realtime: Broadcast 'order:created' to Vendor & Courier Rooms
        Gateway-->>Frontend: 200 OK (Order Confirmed)
        Frontend-->>Customer: Display Order Confirmation & Live Tracking
    else Stock Insufficient
        Gateway->>Database: Abort Transaction & Rollback
        Gateway-->>Frontend: 422 Conflict (Stock Shortage)
        Frontend-->>Customer: Display Out of Stock Alert
    end
